{"3374440": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Majulah: Shape Your City", "steam_appid": 3374440, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and govern a thriving Singapore in this city builder! Plan your city with tactical building placements, Recruit a powerful Cabinet, and secure Building Blueprints during heated parliament sessions. Rally citizen support to ensure re-election and shape your nation's future one term at a time!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build Your Dream City</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategically design your city by placing buildings in optimal locations to unlock their full potential. Experiment with a variety of building types, each offering unique benefits and possibilities.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374440/extras/75d3b46599e7314727e21df68327085f.poster.avif?t=1786040108\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374440/extras/75d3b46599e7314727e21df68327085f.webm?t=1786040108\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374440/extras/75d3b46599e7314727e21df68327085f.mp4?t=1786040108\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Reap the Rewards</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Score points at the end of each turn based on the strategic placement of your buildings. Enhance your gameplay by pairing buildings with powerful Cabinet Member cards, unlocking unique synergies and diverse strategies to outwit your opponents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374440/extras/ecfe062f4a7a951233c99845024af82b.poster.avif?t=1786040108\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374440/extras/ecfe062f4a7a951233c99845024af82b.webm?t=1786040108\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374440/extras/ecfe062f4a7a951233c99845024af82b.mp4?t=1786040108\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Navigate the Halls of Parliament</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare for Parliament Sessions by acquiring Blueprints to construct pivotal buildings. Assemble a dynamic Cabinet to secure your place as a master city planner and politician.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374440/extras/db77944448a4fdf5d93315fa0cbc1f69.poster.avif?t=1786040108\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374440/extras/db77944448a4fdf5d93315fa0cbc1f69.webm?t=1786040108\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374440/extras/db77944448a4fdf5d93315fa0cbc1f69.mp4?t=1786040108\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Win the Election</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outmaneuver your rivals and dominate the political landscape to emerge victorious in the ultimate city-building showdown!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374440/extras/9d53c36ef2dc53d269e163f9406700b7.poster.avif?t=1786040108\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374440/extras/9d53c36ef2dc53d269e163f9406700b7.webm?t=1786040108\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374440/extras/9d53c36ef2dc53d269e163f9406700b7.mp4?t=1786040108\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fill Up Your Roster</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock a vibrant compendium of diverse Cabinet Members, each bringing unique abilities and playstyles to your city-building strategy. Mix and match to create the ultimate team and dominate the political arena!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374440/extras/445afa75cf189f402322a0ea213d7a6a.avif?t=1786040108\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374440/extras_big/445afa75cf189f402322a0ea213d7a6a.webp?t=1786040108 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and govern a thriving Singapore in this city builder! Plan your city with tactical building placements, Recruit a powerful Cabinet, and secure Building Blueprints during heated parliament sessions. Rally citizen support to ensure re-election and shape your nation's future one term at a time!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build Your Dream City</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategically design your city by placing buildings in optimal locations to unlock their full potential. Experiment with a variety of building types, each offering unique benefits and possibilities.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374440/extras/75d3b46599e7314727e21df68327085f.poster.avif?t=1786040108\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.st